      "text": "05 · 怎么衡量"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 564,
      "w": 1400,
      "h": 720,
      "text": "04 · 我的工作"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 860,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "03 · 产品形态"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 760,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "02 · 业务场景"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 380,
      "h": 474,
      "text": "01 · 业务问题"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "招聘跟不上了"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "字节现有的招聘流程有两个不足。（TA：招聘专员，负责具体岗位的招聘。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**效率不够高**\n并发不够，候选人在流程里流转太慢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 324,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**质量不够高**\n招聘质量强依赖 TA 个人的业务能力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "招聘就是匹配，而两头都压在 TA 身上"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 704,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "这个候选人和这个岗位匹不匹配？要判断好，需要两个前提。"
    },
    {
      "id": "m",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 468,
      "y": 246,
      "w": 150,
      "h": 90,
      "text": "**候选人 × 岗位**\n匹配吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "sup",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 668,
      "y": 146,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**供给**\n足够多、信息足够新的候选人"
    },
    {
      "id": "und",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 668,
      "y": 316,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**需求理解**\n这个岗位真正要什么样的人？"
    },
    {
      "id": "bn1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 928,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 244,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "TA 手动从人才库里捞人，同时并行很多岗位。\n\n**→ 效率瓶颈**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bn2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 928,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 244,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "靠 TA 自己对业务的把握。\n\n**→ 质量因人而异**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 28,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "给 TA 的招聘工作台"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 804,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "主要用户：TA 和 sourcer。次要用户：用人经理。"
    },
    {
      "id": "inf",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "rect",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 170,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**基建能力**\n第一件事：把 TA 的日常工具做成平台"
    },
    {
      "id": "sp",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 320,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**供给**\n- **开源：** 官网主投、内推、活水、外部渠道\n- **激活：** 更新意向度、新的项目和经历"
    },
    {
      "id": "dw",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "purple",
      "x": 1824,
      "y": 136,
      "w": 268,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**日常工作的其他环节**\n- 岗位招聘漏斗分析\n- 和用人经理对齐招聘诉求\n- 约面"
    },
    {
      "id": "ah",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "rect",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 306,
      "w": 170,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**Agentic Hiring**\n第二件事：理解准岗位，推得准人"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**澄清**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1615,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**召回**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1742,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**精评**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1869,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**精排**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1996,
      "y": 344,
      "w": 96,
      "h": 64,
      "text": "**用人经理评估**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ahn",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 418,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "TA 或 sourcer 给出岗位需求；Agent 先澄清，再召回、精评、精排。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "我负责的两件事"
    },
    {
      "id": "f4s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 1344,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "A：推荐效果，通过 badcase 归因来优化。   B：产品体验，根据用户反馈来迭代。"
    },
    {
      "id": "qa",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 676,
      "w": 400,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**A · 推荐效果**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bad",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 124,
      "text": "**Badcase**\n来自线上数据：Agent 推了，用人经理评估没过"
    },
    {
      "id": "why",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "diamond",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 112,
      "text": "为什么没理解对岗位？"
    },
    {
      "id": "k1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**1 · 需求清晰，AI 理解有偏差**\nAI 产品岗推出了算法背景的人：做的事不一样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "k2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 112,
      "text": "**2 · 用户没说清楚**\n条件描述模糊，或者不全。"
    },
    {
      "id": "k3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 1016,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 92,
      "text": "**3 · 用户的标准本身不清楚**"
    },
    {
      "id": "x1",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 430,
      "h": 140,
      "text": "**岗位分类**\n- 一级是序列，二级是具体做什么。\n- 给线上岗位和候选人打标，用于召回。\n- 写入精排环节的 system prompt。"
    },
    {
      "id": "x2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 880,
      "w": 430,
      "h": 112,
      "text": "**反问，而不是猜**\n- 模糊：Agent 自检后反馈给用户。\n- 不全：对照完整的条件清单去反问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "x3",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 1016,
      "w": 430,
      "h": 92,
      "text": "**长期偏好记忆**\n从用户的历史行为里把标准抽出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "res",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "green",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 729,
      "w": 210,
      "h": 110,
      "text": "**21% → 25%**\n灰度 AB 实验中的通过率：+4 个百分点"
    },
    {
      "id": "ux",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "body",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 1128,
      "w": 400,
      "h": 24,
      "text": "**B · 产品体验**"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "gray",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 1164,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 76,
      "text": "**用户反馈**\n来自 TA 和 sourcer"
    },
    {
      "id": "k4",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "pink",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 1158,
      "w": 300,
      "h": 88,
      "text": "**用户不知道怎么跟 Agent 描述岗位**"
    },
    {
      "id": "x4",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "yellow",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 1158,
      "w": 430,
      "h": 88,
      "text": "**预制 prompt**\n从现成的草稿开始改，而不是面对空白输入框。"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5h",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "h2",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 592,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 30,
      "text": "准不准，全不全"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5s",
      "type": "text",
      "size": "small",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 630,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 40,
      "text": "两个指标，判断这些工作有没有用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "acc",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 734,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**准不准**\n推的人对不对？"
    },
    {
      "id": "acc2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 714,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**用人经理简历评估通过率**\n评估通过人数 ÷ Agent 推出人数\n- 对标：人类 TA\n- 目标：趋近最优秀的 TA"
    },
    {
      "id": "cov",
      "type": "shape",
      "shape": "round",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1488,
      "y": 954,
      "w": 220,
      "h": 120,
      "text": "**全不全**\n有没有漏掉的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "cov2",
      "type": "sticky",
      "color": "blue",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 934,
      "w": 354,
      "h": 160,
      "text": "**Agent 漏掉了谁？**\n同一个岗位：TA 推过、评估也通过了，但 Agent 没推出来的人。"
    }
  ],
